l\"><p>The number, plainly.</p></div></div><div id=\"pc-matrix-table\" class=\"pagecraft-table-wrap pagecraft--golden-table golden-table\"><table class=\"pagecraft-table\" data-rules=\"rows\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Plan</th><th scope=\"col\">Monthly</th><th scope=\"col\">Seats</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Starter</td><td>£9</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Studio</td><td>£29</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>House</td><td>£79</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id=\"pc-golden-column-secondary\" class=\"pagecraft-column pagecraft--golden-column-secondary golden-column\"><figure id=\"pc-matrix-code\" class=\"pagecraft-code pagecraft--golden-code golden-code\" data-numbers><figcaption class=\"pagecraft-code-head\"><span></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"pagecraft-code-copy\" data-copy hidden>Copy</button></figcaption><pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"pagecraft-code-line\"><span class=\"pc-c-kw\">const</span> portable = <span class=\"pc-c-kw\">true</span>;</span>
