          "bodyHtml": "<section id=\"pc-matrix-section\" class=\"pagecraft-section pagecraft--golden-section golden-section\"><div class=\"pagecraft-container\"><div id=\"pc-matrix-row\" class=\"pagecraft-row pagecraft--golden-row golden-row\"><div id=\"pc-matrix-column\" class=\"pagecraft-column pagecraft--golden-column golden-column\"><h1 id=\"pc-matrix-heading\" bp-duration=\"0.8s\" bp-delay=\"0.1s\" bp-easing=\"ease-out\" bp-animation-once=\"true\" class=\"pagecraft-heading pagecraft--golden-heading ts-title bp-animate pc-fade-up golden-heading\"><a href=\"/\">Every real Pagecraft component</a></h1><div id=\"pc-matrix-text\" class=\"pagecraft-wysiwyg pagecraft--golden-text ts-body golden-text\"><p>Rendered by Core with clean, portable content.</p></div><figure id=\"pc-matrix-quote\" class=\"pagecraft-quote pagecraft--golden-quote ts-lead golden-quote\"><blockquote cite=\"https://example.com/\"><p>Portability is a product feature.</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"pagecraft-attrib\"><a href=\"https://example.com/\">Pagecraft</a></figcaption></figure><figure id=\"pc-matrix-image\" class=\"pagecraft-figure pagecraft--golden-image golden-image\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"pc-asset://assethero\" alt=\"Golden component fixture\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" class=\"pagecraft-image\"></a><figcaption class=\"pagecraft-caption\">A signed raster asset</figcaption></figure><div id=\"pc-matrix-gallery\" class=\"pagecraft-gallery pagecraft-gallery-fixed pagecraft--golden-gallery golden-gallery\" data-lightbox style=\"--g-ratio:4 / 3;--g-fit:cover\"><figure class=\"pagecraft-gallery-item\"><a class=\"pagecraft-gallery-frame\" href=\"pc-asset://assethero\" data-lb=\"0\" aria-label=\"Golden gallery tile\"><img src=\"pc-asset://assethero\" alt=\"Golden gallery tile\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"pagecraft-gallery-img\"></a><figcaption class=\"pagecraft-gallery-caption\">CMS-ready media</figcaption></figure></div><div id=\"pc-matrix-video\" class=\"pagecraft-video pagecraft--golden-video golden-video\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16 / 9\" data-facade><button class=\"pagecraft-video-play\" type=\"button\" data-embed=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aqz-KE-bpKQ?mute=1&amp;muted=1\" aria-label=\"Play video\" data-pagecraft-embed-provider=\"youtube\"><img src=\"pc-asset://assethero\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"pagecraft-video-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></div><a id=\"pc-matrix-icon\" class=\"pagecraft-icon pagecraft--golden-icon golden-icon\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Return home\"><svg class=\"pagecraft-icon-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6.5L9.2 17.3 4 12.1\"/></svg></a><div id=\"pc-matrix-tabs\" class=\"pagecraft-tabs pagecraft--golden-tabs golden-tabs\" data-tabs><div class=\"pagecraft-tablist\" role=\"tablist\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t0\" aria-controls=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"pagecraft-tab on\">Overview</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t1\" aria-controls=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"pagecraft-tab\">Details</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t2\" aria-controls=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"pagecraft-tab\">Pricing</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p0\" aria-labelledby=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t0\" class=\"pagecraft-tabpanel\"><p>What this is, in a sentence or two.</p></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p1\" aria-labelledby=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t1\" data-tab-idle class=\"pagecraft-tabpanel\"><p>The part someone came looking for.</p></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"pc-matrix-tabs-p2\" aria-labelledby=\"pc-matrix-tabs-t2\" data-tab-idle class=\"pagecraft-tabpanel\"><p>The number, plainly.</p></div></div><div id=\"pc-matrix-table\" class=\"pagecraft-table-wrap pagecraft--golden-table golden-table\"><table class=\"pagecraft-table\" data-rules=\"rows\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Plan</th><th scope=\"col\">Monthly</th><th scope=\"col\">Seats</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Starter</td><td>£9</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Studio</td><td>£29</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>House</td><td>£79</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div id=\"pc-golden-column-secondary\" class=\"pagecraft-column pagecraft--golden-column-secondary golden-column\"><figure id=\"pc-matrix-code\" class=\"pagecraft-code pagecraft--golden-code golden-code\" data-numbers><figcaption class=\"pagecraft-code-head\"><span></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"pagecraft-code-copy\" data-copy hidden>Copy</button></figcaption><pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"pagecraft-code-line\"><span class=\"pc-c-kw\">const</span> portable = <span class=\"pc-c-kw\">true</span>;</span>
  <span class=\"pagecraft-code-line\">console.<span class=\"pc-c-fn\">log</span>(portable);</span></code></pre></figure><nav id=\"pc-matrix-crumbs\" class=\"pagecraft-crumbs pagecraft--golden-crumbs golden-crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" data-sep=\"chevron\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/nested/about\">About</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">Page 3</span></li></ol></nav><a id=\"pc-matrix-button\" class=\"pagecraft-button pagecraft--golden-button ts-btn golden-button\" data-variant=\"solid\" href=\"/\"><span>Back home</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 3.5L10.5 8 6 12.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a><nav id=\"pc-matrix-nav\" class=\"pagecraft-nav-menu pagecraft--golden-nav golden-nav\" data-nav data-mobile-menu=\"dropdown\" aria-label=\"Component matrix\"><button class=\"pagecraft-nav-toggle\" data-nav-t type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pc-matrix-nav-menu\" aria-label=\"Component matrix menu\"><span class=\"pagecraft-nav-icon\"></span></button><ul class=\"pagecraft-nav-list\" id=\"pc-matrix-nav-menu\" data-nav-l><li class=\"menu-home\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"menu-about\"><a href=\"/nested/about\">About</a></li><li class=\"menu-external\"><a href=\"https://example.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">External</a></li></ul></nav><form id=\"pc-matrix-form\" class=\"pagecraft-form pagecraft-contact-form golden-form\" aria-label=\"Golden managed form\" action=\"%%PAGECRAFT_FORM_ENDPOINT:contact-form%%\" method=\"post\" data-pagecraft-form-mode=\"wordpress\" data-pagecraft-form-id=\"contact-form\"><div class=\"pagecraft-field\"><label for=\"pc-matrix-form-f0\">Name <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"pc-matrix-form-f0\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"Your name\"></div><div class=\"pagecraft-field\"><label for=\"pc-matrix-form-f1\">Email <sp